# Project design system (reference)

Applies to **every** user-facing surface in this repo (CRM, auth, admin, marketing, shared components, dialogs, tables, forms). Premium enterprise UI: clean hierarchy, 12px radius, 150–200ms transitions, Inter typography, dark sidebar on light canvas.

**Source of truth:** `app/globals.css` (`data-theme` + `.dark`, `--crm-*`, `--ds-*`, shadcn semantic tokens). Theme brand + mode persist via `localStorage` (`buildcon_brand_theme`, `buildcon_color_mode`). Do not invent parallel palettes.

## Brand themes

| Brand | `data-theme` | Primary | Sidebar | Canvas |
|-------|--------------|---------|---------|--------|
| **Executive Blue** (default) | `executive` | `#2563EB` | `#0F172A` | `#F8FAFC` |
| Emerald Estate | `emerald` | `#059669` | `#052E2B` | `#FAFAF9` |
| Luxury Gold | `luxury` | `#C08B2D` | `#18181B` | `#FCFCFA` |

Each brand has a **dark** variant (`.dark` on `<html>`). Components must use semantic tokens so they recolor instantly without per-theme branches.

## Colors (semantic usage)

| Role | Use |
|------|-----|
| Canvas / page bg | `--crm-canvas`, `bg-background` |
| Nav / sidebar chrome | `--sidebar`, `--crm-sidebar-bg`, `bg-sidebar` |
| Primary accent | `--primary`, `--crm-accent`, `ds-primary-500` |
| Emphasis | `ds-primary-600` |
| Soft tint | `ds-primary-100`–`300` |
| Cards | `bg-card` / white on light; shadcn `Card` |
| Text | `text-foreground`, `ds-gray-800`–`900` headings; muted `text-muted-foreground` / `ds-gray-400`–`500` |
| Borders / grid | `border-border`, `ds-gray-100`–`200` |

- Prefer shadcn semantic classes (`bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`) and `ds-*` scales over raw hex.
- Success / warning / error: `ds-success-*`, `ds-warning-*`, `ds-error-*` only for semantic meaning.
- Theme switching: `ThemeProvider` + `ThemeSwitcher` — never hard-code a single brand hue in new UI.

## Surfaces, type, icons

- Cards: `bg-card`, `rounded-xl` (12px), light border, `shadow-sm`, padding `p-4`–`p-6`.
- Active nav: `bg-sidebar-primary` + `text-sidebar-primary-foreground`; inactive = muted sidebar foreground.
- Titles and metrics: semibold/bold; labels: smaller + muted.
- Icons: minimal line style; Inter via `--font-inter`.

## Charts and data viz

Use the **current brand’s** primary scale (`ds-primary-*`) — not a fixed teal palette and not library rainbow defaults.

| Use | Token / value |
|-----|----------------|
| Default bar/segment fill | `ds-primary-200` or `ds-primary-300` |
| Lighter fill / background band | `ds-primary-100`, `ds-primary-50`, or primary at ~12% alpha |
| Multi-series (same chart) | Step `ds-primary-100` → `200` → `300` → `400` |
| Line / emphasis stroke | `ds-primary-500`–`600` |
| Comparison / muted series | `ds-gray-400`–`500` |
| Axes, grid, legend | `ds-gray-100`–`200` grid; `ds-gray-400`–`500` labels |

- Reuse `getDashboardChartColors()` / `CHART_SEGMENT_VAR_NAMES` in `app/crm/dashboard/dashboard-theme.ts` (cache clears on theme change).
- Resolve colors inside chart `useEffect`; depend on theme brand/mode so charts redraw.

## Actions

- Primary button: `bg-primary` + `text-primary-foreground`, `rounded-lg` / `rounded-xl`.
- Secondary: outline / ghost on card surface; avoid gray-filled primaries.

## Shared primitives

- Empty: `components/ui/empty-state.tsx`
- Error: `components/ui/error-state.tsx` + `app/crm/error.tsx`
- Slide-over forms: `components/ui/form-drawer.tsx` (Sheet wrapper)

## Checklist

1. Tokens from `globals.css` — not one-off hex for brand colors.
2. Works in all three brands × light/dark.
3. Same visual language on mobile/tablet (see `responsive-ui-ux` rule).
